OL,3,GNEWSABeatles venue may not play live   
OL,4,Amusic on rooftop                       
OL,6,FPlans to create a museum where The     
OL,7,FBeatles performed their last gig are   
OL,8,Fdue to be approved but on condition no 
OL,9,Flive music can be played on the rooftop
OL,10,Fthat made the Mayfair venue famous.    
OL,12,FApple Corps Ltd, the company founded by
OL,13,Fthe band, wants to convert 3 Savile Row
OL,14,Finto a seven-floor "cultural experience
OL,15,Fand exhibition" celebrating The        
OL,16,FBeatles, with a basement cafe-bar on   
OL,17,Fthe site of the studio where Let It Be 
OL,18,Fwas recorded.                          
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
